<p>A lot of people can't do fireworks because their dogs are terrified of them. Luckily that's not the case
with Ella and Lilly. They're watched so many Avengers movies with us for so long that when they hear bangs,
crashes, or see flashing lights, they just assume Thanos is trying to destroy the Earth again.</p>

